# Measured off art/back.jpg (test_data, plate 2, nothing lettered on it),
# as fractions of its width (728px): even violet stock, the debossed
# colophon (an oval, one paper doll inside) between 0.52 and 0.88,
# centred on the width; the darker band from 1.272 to the foot. No frame
# on the plate, so the screenshots take the top of the face, two frames at
# the shots' own proportion (600x520), as health_probe set them; the
# plate's one blemish, a small square at 0.80,0.19, falls under the
# second frame. The accent is the front's paper, the one colour the era
# put beside its ground that reads on violet.
